<title>GREECE: Avg price on Greek FRN/bond auction at 100.3/99.82.</title>
<headline>Avg price on Greek FRN/bond auction at 100.3/99.82.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following information on Greece's auction of seven-year floaters and three-year coupon bonds was made available by the Bank of Greece.</p>
<p>			 7-YEAR FLOATING RATE NOTES FORMULA</p>
<p>12MTH T-BILL		 + 1.40%</p>
<p>12MTH T-BILL		  12%</p>
<p>MIN PRICE		    100.303</p>
<p>AVERAGE PRICE		100.361</p>
<p>MAX OFFERED PRICE	  100.560</p>
<p>COMPETITIVE AMOUNT	 200 BLN DRACHMAS</p>
<p>NON-COMPETITIVE AMOUNT    60 BLN DRACHMAS</p>
<p>			  3-YEAR COUPON BONDS</p>
<p> MIN PRICE				99.550</p>
<p> AVERAGE PRICE			  99.823</p>
<p> MAXIMUM PRICE			 100.800</p>
<p> COMPETITIVE AMOUNT		  100 BLN DRACHMAS</p>
<p> NON-COMPETITIVE			30 BLN DRACHMAS</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
